#. module: delivery_dachser
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_dachser.field_delivery_carrier__dachser_rate_mode
msgid ""
"- API Quotation with Local Tariff Table Fallback: Queries Dachser's /rest/v2/quotations endpoint in real time and, if no online rate is available for that destination or token, computes the rate using the local zone/weight/pallet tariff table.\n"
"- Online API Quotation Only: Retrieves the quotation exclusively from Dachser's server.\n"
"- Local Tariff Table Only: Computes immediately using the rules configured in Odoo without network requests."
msgstr ""

#. module: delivery_dachser
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_dachser.field_delivery_carrier__dachser_operation_mode
msgid ""
"- Full Transport Order (/rest/v2/transportorders): Creates the shipment in eLogistics/TMS and returns labels and SSCCs.\n"
"- SSCC Labels + LDR Routing Only (/rest/v2/labels): Generates PDF/ZPL labels, SSCC license plates, and LDR routing code without recording a TMS order (compatible with immediate 10-day self-service test tokens)."
msgstr ""

#. module: delivery_dachser
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:delivery_dachser.field_delivery_carrier__dachser_basket
msgid ""
"- imported: Creates an editable draft in eLogistics without label.\n"
"- labelled: Creates the order in eLogistics and returns PDF/ZPL labels and SSCC codes (recommended).\n"
"- sent: Creates the order, returns labels, and transmits it directly to Dachser TMS (not editable or cancellable via API)."
msgstr ""

